{"overview":"شروع مجدد کار راحتی نیست، به‌خصوص برای جوان شهرستانی جان نولان، که پس از یک حادثه سرنوشت‌ساز، رویای خود برای یک افسر پلیس لوس‌آنجلس شده را دنبال می‌کند. او به‌عنوان مسن‌ترین تازه‌کار این نیرو، با بدبینی برخی از افراد رده بالا روبرو می‌شود که او را فقط یک بحران میان‌سالی گذرا می‌بینند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Starting over isn't easy, especially for small-town guy John Nolan who, after a life-altering incident, is pursuing his dream of being an LAPD officer. As the force's oldest rookie, he's met with skepticism from some higher-ups who see him as just a walking midlife crisis.","tagline_en":"Never off duty.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":20,"y":2018,"poster":"/9oRc3hNfKEvtwY9EV66dqkNYHp9.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":20,"y":2019,"poster":"/wZGI608MRMu3XPAz2UCgm3CcRKZ.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":14,"y":2021,"poster":"/6hChiX0vIjWY4y2kz1WndHVMsDu.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":22,"y":2021,"poster":"/gSGj4zhuFllpZEkHGdsBMV2BGsq.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":22,"y":2022,"poster":"/cofQdlJ0voWzWlpisBqfuRChTbf.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":10,"y":2024,"poster":"/wbeqBUFydztHDQ4h7dZqnknh5HE.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":18,"y":2025,"poster":"/lzj5hEKBuiJ86gSVY8BdLiigWiU.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":18,"y":2026,"poster":"/3zEqWPODdrzQNOB77eYdzgL0z5l.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":1,"y":2027,"poster":""}],"episodes":145,"crew":["Alexi Hawley"],"countries":["US","CA"],"cast":[{"name":"ناتان فیلیون","role":"John Nolan","photo":"/aW6vCxkUZtwb6iH2Wf88Uq0XNVv.jpg"},{"name":"Melissa O'Neil","role":"Lucy Chen","photo":"/9KqgbNttW79hAP9xQ5Ffd2fjGk.jpg"},{"name":"اریک وینتر","role":"Tim Bradford","photo":"/tDQSZv5rHm4s2hwwVWpp5EMQ0w9.jpg"},{"name":"Alyssa Diaz","role":"Angela Lopez","photo":"/ihLNjM4E1Fjx5h4l8EL6r3iDRTa.jpg"},{"name":"Mekia Cox","role":"Nyla Harper","photo":"/r8RrebMle9U3Xiwl2hiD6pFdfSl.jpg"},{"name":"ریچارد تی. جونز","role":"Wade Grey","photo":"/hdko2C45Wr5G03Z8JwGjWMynP84.